      <div type="clause" n="13, 13.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Rect">Rect</ref> 13, 13.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Be ku hyrde . Cuhyrde gebyreð þæt he hæbbe ealdre cu meolc .vii. niht syððan heo nige cealfod heafð 7 frymetlinge bystin|ge .xiiii. niht 7 ga his mete cu mid hlafordes cu.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">Concerning the cowherd To the cowherd is due that he has the milk of a mature cow for seven nights after she has had a new calf, and the colostrum of a young cow for fourteen nights. And his food cow [may] go with the lord’s cow[s].</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">[13] Be kuhyrde. Cuhyrde gebyreð , þæt he hæbbe ealdre cu meolc VII niht, syððan heo nige cealfod hæfð, 7 frymetlinge bystinge XIIII niht. [13.1] 7 ga his metecu mid hlafordes cu.</ab>
      </div>
